	(text "- Assuming we have +/-15V supplies.\n- Phantom power only interacts with the microphones.\n- All components that are not ICs are placeholders\n  until the final design (i.e. until specific components\n  are chosen)!\n- Buck converter uses a 1MHz clock frequency to\n  obtain a ripple current of 100uA.\n- Delay filters attenuate signals beyond 15KHz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.098 394.462 0)
		(effects
